{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は先日まで\n原宿ラフォーレミュージアムで開催されていた\n「渡辺直美展」に行ってきた話をします〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その名の通り、渡辺直美さんの\n世界観や写真や映像たっぷり！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中高生の若い女の子達に紛れて、\n1人で行ってきました( ◦˙ ˙◦ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんに\n流石に1人じゃ恥ずかしいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って聞いたら\n全然いいよ！胸張って行ってきな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われたので胸張って\n1人で楽しんできました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/08/6667734/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは食品サンプルなんだけど、\nとっても量が多い！！大きい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山盛りスパゲティ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/08/6667734/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"漫画肉\" と言われる大きなお肉と、\nチャーハン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食品サンプルが沢山テーブルに並んでる姿\nとっても可愛かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして美味しそうだった。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋